      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://twinlakesconservancy.org/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Camp Tiyalaka brought people from outside the region to experience the natural beauty of the Twin Lakes area.",
